      "title": "Suggestion: Novastart for Tools / Others",
      "description": "I’m Thomas Fraher, co-founder & CTO of Novastart. I’d like to suggest it for the Tools → Others section alongside collaborative whiteboards.\n\nSuggested entry:\n- [Novastart](https://novastart.com/) - Infinite-canvas workspace with shared whiteboards, apps and AI agents.\n\nRemote teams can organize apps and ideas on shared canvases for visual planning and collaboration. There is a Free plan; optional Pro is $10/month and Team is $20/month per user.\n\nI searched existing issues and pull requests for Novastart and found no matching suggestion. Thanks for considering it.",
